[12C[1;30mto present a groovy new pack. Sorry this pack was delayed[0m[4C[1;30m    [0m 
[1;30m [0m[11C[1;30ma week. This was due to some internal reorganisation and[0m
[1;30m [0m[11C[1;30mdue to the coding of our new ansiviewer.[0m
[1;30m [0m[11C[1;30mWe've gone through some[0m [1;30mchanges in the past two[0m [1;30mmonths.[0m
[1;30m [0m[11C[1;30mFirst, I introduce to you[0m [1;30ma new member,[0m The Stinger[1;30m,[0m
[1;30m [0m[11C[1;30mwho will add another surplus[0m [1;30mto our already quite[0m
[1;30m [0m[11C[1;30mestablished squad. He's our first[0m [1;30mnon-belgian ansidrawin'[0m
[1;30m [0m[11C[1;30mmember. Next new guy is [0mThe Mod[1;30m,[0m [1;30mwhom I met at Bizarre '95[0m
[12C[1;30min Holland. He's quite good and[0m [1;30mhas developed[0m [1;30mhis own[0m
[12C[1;30mstyle. Pitty the ansi compo at[0m [1;30mBizarre was fucked up.[0m
[12C[1;30mThere were only three entries but[0m [1;30mthe whole thing[0m [1;30mwas a[0m
[12C[1;30mlaugh. If it were an honest compo, he might've won it.[0m
[12C[1;30mAt Bizarre, we had a lot of requests for ansi screens, but[0m
[12C[1;30mit was rather strange that *all* of the guys wanted a[0m
[1;30m            23 max line ansi. That explains why there will be quite[0m
[1;30m            some of those in this pack.[0m[3C[1;30m [0m
[1;30m            The next huge change is[0m [1;30mthe[0m [1;30mawesome new [0mansiviewer[1;30m,[0m [1;30mthat[0m
[1;30m [0m[11C[1;30mwas coded by [0mByron[1;30m and[0m Ben Hurry[1;30m.[0m [1;30mUse it, it's got some[0m
[1;30m [0m[11C[1;30mfeatures never seen before[0m [1;30m(as far as I know).[0m
[12C[1;30mYou'll probably notice that[0m [1;30mour ansi division is growing[0m
[12C[1;30mstronger every pack.[0m[8C[1;30m [0m[20C[1;30m [0m
[12C[1;30mI consider this normal, since we all put a lot of effort [0m
[12C[1;30min it. And it will only get better. So if you're a[0m
[12C[1;30mtalented drawer, don't hesitate to join one of Europe's[0m
[12C[1;30mbest and fastest growing ansi-groups. Also other            [0m
[12C[1;30m(existing) ansi-groups can get in touch with us if they     [0m
[12C[1;30mare interested in merging with FUEL.[0m

[12C[1;30mWell, enjoy the pack...Requests are welcome, reactions[0m
[1;30m            too... actually everything is welcome, just let us know[0m
[1;30m            what you think.[0m


